  "story": {
    "day": 105,
    "title": "A Saturday in the City",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya, fourteen, woke up early on the twentieth.",
      "It was Saturday. She would go to the city at ten a.m.",
      "Her friend, Hana, twelve, would join her for shopping.",
      "They planned to look for new shorts at a department store.",
      "Kaya was a member of the school's musical club.",
      "The director needed an instrument for them, which broke on the fourteenth.",
      "They walked past the bank. An elderly man sat there.",
      "He dropped a note about his medicine. Kaya worried about him.",
      "Perhaps his wife had to be in the hospital.",
      "Later, Kaya had a video call with her mother. \"Did you clean your room?\"",
      "Kaya sometimes babysat her cousin. She loved roast olive bread, theirs.",
      "She took off her shoes and watched a boy skate near the museum."
    ]
  }
